178 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 124 0 R
/T (At Dreams of Bangladesh, we believe in the trans-formative power of technology. Our mission goes beyond technological advancement; it is about creating a significant impact on society. We are committed to bridging the digital divide, ensuring that technological literacy and empowerment reach every corner of Bangladesh. By fostering a culture of innovation, we aim to inspire and nurture the next generation of tech leaders and entrepreneurs, driving economic growth and social development. Our initiatives span a wide array of sectors, including education, healthcare, agriculture, and sustainable development, aligning with the UN Sustainable Development Goals. We are dedicated to developing ethical and sustainable technologies that address pressing global challenges and improve the quality of life for all. We conduct seminars and workshops in educational institutions, bringing technology closer to students and encouraging them to explore and innovate. Dreams of Bangladesh is built on collaboration and partnership. We have forged strategic alliances with international organizations and participated in numerous knowledge exchange programs, enriching our expertise and expanding our horizons. Our commitment to continuous learning and adaptation ensures that we remain at the forefront of technological advancements, ready to tackle the challenges of tomorrow. Our slogan, "Where Innovation Begins, INNOVATING Locally, IMPACTING Globally," encapsulates our vision and mission. We are not just about technology; we are about using technology to make a positive impact on the world. We aim to connect rural and urban populations with technology, ensuring that everyone, regardless of their location, has the opportunity to learn, innovate, and contribute. Dreams of Bangladesh invites you to join us on this trans-formative journey. Together, we will forge a future where innovation knows no bounds, technology empowers every individual, and Bangladesh stands tall as a beacon of progress and excellence on the global stage. Welcome to a world where dreams are realized through innovation, dedication, and collective effort. Welcome to Dreams of Bangladesh.)
/E (At Dreams of Bangladesh, we believe in the trans-formative power of technology. Our mission goes beyond technological advancement; it is about creating a significant impact on society. We are committed to bridging the digital divide, ensuring that technological literacy and empowerment reach every corner of Bangladesh. By fostering a culture of innovation, we aim to inspire and nurture the next generation of tech leaders and entrepreneurs, driving economic growth and social development. Our initiatives span a wide array of sectors, including education, healthcare, agriculture, and sustainable development, aligning with the UN Sustainable Development Goals. We are dedicated to developing ethical and sustainable technologies that address pressing global challenges and improve the quality of life for all. We conduct seminars and workshops in educational institutions, bringing technology closer to students and encouraging them to explore and innovate. Dreams of Bangladesh is built on collaboration and partnership. We have forged strategic alliances with international organizations and participated in numerous knowledge exchange programs, enriching our expertise and expanding our horizons. Our commitment to continuous learning and adaptation ensures that we remain at the forefront of technological advancements, ready to tackle the challenges of tomorrow. Our slogan, "Where Innovation Begins, INNOVATING Locally, IMPACTING Globally," encapsulates our vision and mission. We are not just about technology; we are about using technology to make a positive impact on the world. We aim to connect rural and urban populations with technology, ensuring that everyone, regardless of their location, has the opportunity to learn, innovate, and contribute. Dreams of Bangladesh invites you to join us on this trans-formative journey. Together, we will forge a future where innovation knows no bounds, technology empowers every individual, and Bangladesh stands tall as a beacon of progress and excellence on the global stage. Welcome to a world where dreams are realized through innovation, dedication, and collective effort. Welcome to Dreams of Bangladesh.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
