/T (Projects and Innovations 1. BengalNav: Obstacle Avoiding Robot A robot designed to navigate complex environments, avoiding obstacles with precision, symbolizing resilience and adaptability. 2. DeltaPath: Line Follower Robot A robot that follows designated paths with high accuracy, representing the steady progress of Bangladesh's technological advancements. 3. BengalBlitz: Soccer Robot An agile and precise robot built for robotic soccer matches, showcasing the spirit of teamwork and competition. 4. SundarScan: Ultrasonic Radar An innovative radar system utilizing ultrasonic waves to detect objects and map surroundings, inspired by the Sundarbans' rich biodiversity. 5. AgroNova Series \(Versions 1-7\) A series of agricultural robots designed for various farming tasks, enhancing productivity and efficiency in Bangladesh's agricultural sector. 6. CovidGuard: COVID Prevention System An integrated system using robotics to enforce social distancing, monitor health parameters, and sanitize environments, ensuring safety during the pandemic. 7. AquaPal: Aquatic Friendly Robot A robot designed for underwater tasks, promoting sustainability and assisting in aquatic research, reflecting Bangladesh's connection with water bodies.)
/E (Projects and Innovations 1. BengalNav: Obstacle Avoiding Robot A robot designed to navigate complex environments, avoiding obstacles with precision, symbolizing resilience and adaptability. 2. DeltaPath: Line Follower Robot A robot that follows designated paths with high accuracy, representing the steady progress of Bangladesh's technological advancements. 3. BengalBlitz: Soccer Robot An agile and precise robot built for robotic soccer matches, showcasing the spirit of teamwork and competition. 4. SundarScan: Ultrasonic Radar An innovative radar system utilizing ultrasonic waves to detect objects and map surroundings, inspired by the Sundarbans' rich biodiversity. 5. AgroNova Series \(Versions 1-7\) A series of agricultural robots designed for various farming tasks, enhancing productivity and efficiency in Bangladesh's agricultural sector. 6. CovidGuard: COVID Prevention System An integrated system using robotics to enforce social distancing, monitor health parameters, and sanitize environments, ensuring safety during the pandemic. 7. AquaPal: Aquatic Friendly Robot A robot designed for underwater tasks, promoting sustainability and assisting in aquatic research, reflecting Bangladesh's connection with water bodies.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
