/T (8. CareBot: Helping Robot A versatile robot developed to assist with daily tasks, providing aid to the elderly and differently-abled, embodying the spirit of care and service. 9. FireSentinel: Firefighter Robot An advanced robot capable of detecting and extinguishing fires, ensuring safety in hazardous environments, named after the guardian spirit of fire. 10. AgriSense: Advanced IoT Farming System A cutting-edge farming system using IoT devices to monitor and manage agricultural activities, ensuring optimal crop yield and resource usage. 11. SensorMatrix: 20 Types of Sensors Project A comprehensive project showcasing various sensor technologies and their applications in robotics and automation, symbolizing the power of innovation. 12. LearnBot: Machine Learning Using Robot A robot that utilizes machine learning algorithms to adapt and improve its functions, representing continuous learning and growth.)
