/T (Ideas About Smart Agriculture 1. FishTech: Aquaculture Enhancement Devices Increasing the use of devices capable of assisting fish farming and testing water quality in ponds to ensure optimal conditions for aquaculture. 2. CropTech: IoT-Enhanced Farming Application of IoT and sensors for precise application of fertilizers, irrigation, and pesticides, enhancing the production of high-value fruits and crops. 3. SprayDrone: Pesticide Application Drones Use of drones to safely and efficiently spray pesticides, reducing the labor and risk associated with human application. 4. AgriAI: AI-Driven Crop Management AI-driven crop and variety selection, and intermanagement system to adapt to climate and weather changes for optimal agricultural outcomes. 5. HarvestBot: Automated Harvesting Robots designed to address labor shortages during harvest, ensuring timely and efficient collection of crops. 6. AutoFeeder: Smart Fish Feeders Automated fish feeders for pond farming, providing consistent and optimal feeding schedules to improve fish growth and health. 7. FertiLink: Digital Fertilizer Distribution Digitizing fertilizer distribution to ensure farmers receive fertilizers at the right time and price, reducing delays and harassment.)
